"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1720406005":{"text":"男爵が怒りの形相のまま立ち去ると、途方に暮れる守備軍、商品を奪われた露店主、そして野次馬の市民たちは互いに顔を見合わせた。","source_cn":"男爵气冲冲地离开了，留下束手无策的守备军、被抢的摊主和看热闹的市民们面面相觑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11C86B5695A997A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1720406006:0":{"text":"さっきの奴は誰なんだ？やけに偉そうだったが。","source_cn":"刚刚那人是谁啊？口气那么大！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B0D5E7EEDE0BA59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1720406007:0":{"text":"あの方は……グランデ男爵です。","source_cn":"那位是葛朗台男爵……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12860A5E56B419D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1720406008:0":{"text":"聞いたこともないわ。どうせ田舎から出てきた成金でしょ。","source_cn":"听都没听说过，估计又是哪个从乡下来的暴发户吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8746E7D0B7E1A860","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1720406009:1":{"text":"サバンナには貴族がそこら中にいて、それこそ石を投げれば子爵の一人や二人に当たるわよ。そんな場所で何を威張り散らかしてるんだか！","source_cn":"赛凡纳的贵族遍地都是，天上掉下块石头，都能砸到不止一个...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA966258F8F34E495","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1720406010:1":{"text":"ふん、あのデブ貴族こそ猿みたいだったな。たとえ金貨を一万枚積まれたって、あいつにだけは仕えたくないね！","source_cn":"哼，那胖贵族自己就是个猴样！就算给我一万金币，我也不伺候他！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA05A3694B7D4DB6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1720406011:0":{"text":"王子に猿とオウムを献上するってのも、どうもきな臭い話よね……","source_cn":"他要献给王子猴子和鹦鹉？我看这事不简单。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x556FE14AE971E710","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1720406012:1":{"text":"まさか、王妃の差し金だったりして。凶暴な動物たちを使って、王子殿下に危害を加えようとしてるとか？","source_cn":"这猴子这么凶猛，鹦鹉这么聒噪，是不是王后那边派来的，想...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E58264625F2F548","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1720406013:1":{"text":"バカなことを言うな！あの聡明で勇ましい王子殿下に、動物を差し向けたところで何になる？","source_cn":"胡说！王子殿下英明神武，岂会怕这两个家伙？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42961939A00F065B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1720406014:1":{"text":"だって王子は王妃の実子じゃないでしょ？用心するに越したことはないわ。","source_cn":"毕竟王子不是王后亲生的，不得不防啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x899B8D6190D3209C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","documen